    "- 60 to 79 – Grade B\n",
    "- 40 to 59 – Grade C\n",
    "- Below 40 – Failed\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Write a Python program to display the day of the week based on a number entered by the user (1–7).\n",
    "    \n",
    "4. Write a Python program to display the name of a month based on a number entered by the user (1–12).\n",
    "\n",
    "5. Write a Python program to classify a person's age:\n",
    "- 0–12: Child\n",
    "- 13–19: Teenager\n",
    "- 20–59: Adult\n",
    "- 60 and above: Senior Citizen\n",
    "\n",
    "6. Write a Python program to classify a person's BMI:\n",
    "- Below 18.5: Underweight\n",
    "- 18.5–24.9: Normal Weight\n",
    "- 25–29.9: Overweight\n",
    "- 30 and above: Obese\n",
    "\n",
    "7. Write a Python program to calculate a discount based on shopping amount:\n",
    "- Below ₹1,000: No Discount\n",
    "- ₹1,000–₹4,999: 5% Discount\n",
    "- ₹5,000–₹9,999: 10% Discount\n",
    "- ₹10,000 and above: 15% Discount"
